{"num":799,"id":"2026-025","year":"2026","num0":"025","stars":3,"univ":"신슈대학교","track":"의학부","subj":"대수","text":"tan 20∘ tan 30∘ tan 40∘ − tan 10∘ 의 값을 구하여라. 729","qimg":["p/jp/2026-025-q0.webp"],"simg":["p/jp/2026-025-s0.webp"],"ja":[{"p":"$\\tan20^\\circ\\tan30^\\circ\\tan40^\\circ-\\tan10^\\circ$ の値を求めよ。"}],"sim":{"ja":[{"p":"(1) $\\tan\\theta\\tan(60^\\circ-\\theta)\\tan(60^\\circ+\\theta)=\\tan3\\theta$ を示せ。"},{"p":"(2) $\\tan10^\\circ\\tan50^\\circ\\tan70^\\circ$ の値を求めよ。"}],"ans":{"ja":"(2) $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}3$"},"sol":{"ja":[{"p":"(1) $\\tan(60^\\circ-\\theta)\\tan(60^\\circ+\\theta)=\\dfrac{3-\\tan^2\\theta}{1-3\\tan^2\\theta}$ (加法定理)。$t=\\tan\\theta$ として $\\dfrac{t(3-t^2)}{1-3t^2}=\\dfrac{3t-t^3}{1-3t^2}=\\tan3\\theta$。"},{"p":"(2) $\\theta=10^\\circ$ とすると $\\tan10^\\circ\\tan50^\\circ\\tan70^\\circ=\\tan30^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}3$。"}]}},"art":""}